<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-162] ParquetThrift should throw when unrecognized columns are passed to the column projection API</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-162</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It appears that giving wrong / unrecognized column names to the projection API doesn&apos;t fail fast or even report that the columns were unrecognized at all.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should also log at start up what columns are being projected, this is useful info to have in the logs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
